        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced 2D pixel-art boss rush where you unleash the bug swarms you accidentally woke onto towering bosses. Trigger the right bug at the right moment, manage the chaos, and survive every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with its own attack patterns and increasingly punishing phases. You set off different bug types along the way, using each one's unique ability to turn the tide of battle. The controls are tight, so if your reflexes are quick enough, you'll be the one making the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the points you earn to power up your bugs and unlock new tactics. With classic pixel aesthetics and a relentless chiptune soundtrack, every clash is its own challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage and take down the bosses one by one.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced 2D pixel-art boss rush where you unleash the bug swarms you accidentally woke onto towering bosses. Trigger the right bug at the right moment, manage the chaos, and survive every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with its own attack patterns and increasingly punishing phases. You set off different bug types along the way, using each one's unique ability to turn the tide of battle. The controls are tight, so if your reflexes are quick enough, you'll be the one making the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the points you earn to power up your bugs and unlock new tactics. With classic pixel aesthetics and a relentless chiptune soundtrack, every clash is its own challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage and take down the bosses one by one.</p>",
        "short_description": "Step into a relentless 2D pixel-art boss rush where every mis-fired bug is your secret weapon. Accidentally awaken swarms of “bugs” and unleash them on colossal bosses! Adapt on the fly, master chaos, and prove your reflexes in the ultimate pixel showdown. 💥⚔️",
